that even someone like me

272
00:23:14.125 --> 00:23:16.666
can make a modest contribution.

273
00:23:19.958 --> 00:23:21.625
So please forgive me

274
00:23:22.208 --> 00:23:24.041
but I have to go now.

275
00:23:24.125 --> 00:23:26.125
Thank you for your attention.

276
00:23:29.958 --> 00:23:31.708
We are very sorry for this.

277
00:23:32.291 --> 00:23:36.208
Now we will answer your questions
our shareholders.

278
00:23:36.791 --> 00:23:40.791
Anyone who has a question
is asked to raise his hand.

279
00:23:42.958 --> 00:23:45.583
Please, person in the middle row

280
00:23:45.666 --> 00:23:48.000
in a navy blue sweater.

281
00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:51.500
I am number 28

282
00:23:52.333 --> 00:23:54.333
Fumiko Kuroiwa.

283
00:23:54.958 --> 00:23:59.000
My husband is Kenji Kuroiwa, the pastry chef

284
00:23:59.083 --> 00:24:02.083
and former boss of the Savior.

285
00:24:05.875 --> 00:24:08.625
After losing my husband

286
00:24:08.708 --> 00:24:11.625
I was struggling with a serious mental illness.

287
00:24:13.208 --> 00:24:18.333
When I finally got my act together again
the courage to leave the house,

288
00:24:19.500 --> 00:24:23.166
the first person who comforted me,

289
00:24:23.666 --> 00:24:27.458
was Mr. Sosuke Fujiwara,
who gave me chocolate.

290
00:24:28.666 --> 00:24:33.750
It can bring happiness and relief
with one chocolate.

291
00:24:34.708 --> 00:24:36.708
I want to support this miracle,

292
00:24:38.041 --> 00:24:40.416
which he creates.

293
00:24:42.166 --> 00:24:49.166
I fully support it
current president, Sosuke Fujiwara.

294
00:25:09.833 --> 00:25:14.416
Thanks to everyone's support
I can stand here today.

295
00:25:14.916 --> 00:25:17.750
I am grateful to you with all my heart.

296
00:25:18.500 --> 00:25:20.625
Thank you, Jill.

297
00:25:20.708 --> 00:25:22.458
Thank you very much, Jil.

298
00:25:23.541 --> 00:25:26.250
Then Ms. Lee Hana from The Savior.

299
00:25:26.333 --> 00:25:27.416
Please.

300
00:25:27.500 --> 00:25:30.250
Now Ms. Hana Lee from The Savior.

301
00:25:30.333 --> 00:25:32.416
We invite you to the stage.

302
00:25:41.250 --> 00:25:45.541
Will you tell us about your chocolate?

303
00:25:45.625 --> 00:25:48.250
Will you tell us about your chocolate?

304
00:25:57.958 --> 00:25:59.125
My…

305
00:26:04.166 --> 00:26:08.041
The chocolate I made…

306
00:26:16.083 --> 00:26:16.916
Hana!

307
00:26:17.000 --> 00:26:18.583
It's okay, Hana!

308
00:26:19.083 --> 00:26:20.375
You're doing great!

309
00:27:03.833 --> 00:27:04.833
Impossible.

310
00:27:17.500 --> 00:27:18.583
I am…

311
00:27:20.666 --> 00:27:24.166
someone who was saved by chocolates.

312
00:27:25.875 --> 00:27:29.041
Only when I made chocolates

313
00:27:29.625 --> 00:27:31.666
I felt really happy.

314
00:27:33.083 --> 00:27:35.375
They gave me strength to live.

315
00:27:36.750 --> 00:27:41.166
I made this chocolate with hope,
that he will do the same

316
00:27:42.375 --> 00:27:44.458
for someone who is having problems right now.

317
00:27:46.166 --> 00:27:48.125
No matter what the result

318
00:27:48.916 --> 00:27:53.750
I hope it's the chocolate
it will bring you all happiness.

319
00:27:55.583 --> 00:27:56.875
Thank you very much.

320
00:28:21.875 --> 00:28:24.000
A JAPANESE SAVIOR TAKES THE CROWN!

321
00:28:32.708 --> 00:28:36.791
APPLICATION FOR RELEASE SHUNTARO
AND SOSUKE FUJIWARA REJECTED

322
00:28:37.375 --> 00:28:39.708
Yes.

323
00:28:45.083 --> 00:28:46.416
You were great!

324
00:28:46.500 --> 00:28:48.291
I was moved!

325
00:28:48.375 --> 00:28:51.000
It was amazing!

326
00:28:51.083 --> 00:28:54.750
- Thanks for representing the Savior!
- It was the boss, right?

327
00:28:54.833 --> 00:28:56.916
You calmed down when you saw him.

328
00:28:57.000 --> 00:28:58.750
I was a little nervous.

329
00:28:58.833 --> 00:28:59.875
True?

330
00:28:59.958 --> 00:29:02.291
- Congratulations!
- That was great!

331
00:29:02.375 --> 00:29:03.583
Are you sure?

332
00:29:06.125 --> 00:29:07.416
Look at this!

333
00:29:07.500 --> 00:29:10.000
We won!

334
00:29:51.125 --> 00:29:52.833
One more thing.

335
00:29:53.583 --> 00:29:56.208
Can I ask you one question?

336
00:29:56.291 --> 00:29:57.708
As a friend.

337
00:29:58.708 --> 00:29:59.875
What is it about?

338
00:30:00.375 --> 00:30:01.916
Why

339
00:30:02.958 --> 00:30:06.791
Can I look Mr. Fujiwara in the eye?

340
00:30:10.250 --> 00:30:13.750
How do you feel when you look at Sosuke?

341
00:30:15.708 --> 00:30:17.666
When I look at him…

342
00:30:21.250 --> 00:30:23.583
Since I first saw him

343
00:30:23.666 --> 00:30:26.833
I don't know why
but I was still thinking about him.

344
00:30:39.125 --> 00:30:41.458
He's going down a bit.

345
00:30:51.666 --> 00:30:53.375
You had a petal in your hair.

346
00:31:03.916 --> 00:31:05.458
Seeing his look…

347
00:31:07.541 --> 00:31:09.791
I know what he wants to say.

348
00:31:10.875 --> 00:31:12.458
If he has sad eyes,

349
00:31:12.541 --> 00:31:16.166
for some reason I feel sad too.

350
00:31:17.541 --> 00:31:20.708
I sense his satisfaction.

351
00:31:28.500 --> 00:31:31.625
Wherever he is,
my eyes follow him.

352
00:31:32.500 --> 00:31:34.958
If it's not there, I start looking for it.

353
00:31:37.541 --> 00:31:38.750
Mrs. Hana.

354
00:31:39.250 --> 00:31:41.375
It sounds like you're in love.

355
00:31:42.583 --> 00:31:44.625
As if he were your soul mate.

356
00:31:45.541 --> 00:31:46.375
What?

357
00:32:00.458 --> 00:32:03.083
I understand now.

358
00:32:07.125 --> 00:32:08.166
This is…

359
00:32:09.250 --> 00:32:11.250
my true confession.

360
00:32:17.500 --> 00:32:18.708
I love you.

361
00:32:24.958 --> 00:32:25.833
That's not it.

362
00:32:29.375 --> 00:32:30.458
This is…

363
00:32:33.791 --> 00:32:34.666
sarang.

364
00:33:36.250 --> 00:33:37.666
I thought if

365
00:33:38.958 --> 00:33:41.041
I will take everything, I will be happy.

366
00:33:44.625 --> 00:33:46.541
But even if I achieved my goal,

367
00:33:48.208 --> 00:33:50.458
I didn't think that…

368
00:33:52.791 --> 00:33:54.708
I'll feel so crappy.

369
00:33:58.833 --> 00:34:01.958
Since dad died...

370
00:34:04.250 --> 00:34:06.041
my uncle was like a father to me.

371
00:34:08.250 --> 00:34:10.291
And you were my family.

372
00:34:13.083 --> 00:34:16.458
I never wanted to trample
something so precious

373
00:34:17.666 --> 00:34:20.500
just to take over Futago Sweets.

374
00:34:22.125 --> 00:34:23.250
I just...

375
00:34:27.291 --> 00:34:28.833
I wanted to gain recognition.

376
00:34:32.166 --> 00:34:33.333
Your…

377
00:34:35.500 --> 00:34:36.583
and uncle.

378
00:34:41.166 --> 00:34:42.333
Always…

379
00:34:45.791 --> 00:34:48.666
you put me first.

380
00:34:50.583 --> 00:34:53.666
And I never showed you any gratitude.

381
00:34:57.708 --> 00:35:00.791
Probably because I was worthless.

382
00:35:02.375 --> 00:35:04.500
I should be more grateful.

383
00:35:07.208 --> 00:35:09.416
I underestimated you because you were family.

384
00:35:11.916 --> 00:35:12.958
Sorry.

385
00:35:16.208 --> 00:35:17.791
Maybe we'll join forces from now on?

386
00:35:18.291 --> 00:35:21.041
We can run the company together.

387
00:35:23.000 --> 00:35:28.375
we can't afford
to lose someone as talented as you.

388
00:35:30.541 --> 00:35:31.583
But…

389
00:35:34.791 --> 00:35:37.083
I will be your shadow again.

390
00:35:39.333 --> 00:35:40.291
For good.

391
00:35:42.541 --> 00:35:47.041
No one is just light or shadow.

392
00:35:48.041 --> 00:35:50.666
Shadow cannot exist without light,

393
00:35:50.750 --> 00:35:53.000
and light cannot exist without shadow.

394
00:35:53.791 --> 00:35:56.333
This is what makes a team.

395
00:36:01.541 --> 00:36:06.000
Dad always said that when he thanked his uncle.

396
00:36:13.291 --> 00:36:14.125
Exactly

397
00:36:15.333 --> 00:36:16.541
You're touched, aren't you?

398
00:36:18.750 --> 00:36:20.916
It shows.

399
00:36:25.250 --> 00:36:27.000
You are so irritating.

400
00:36:28.166 --> 00:36:30.208
And seriously, "the two of us"?

401
00:36:34.833 --> 00:36:35.875
Sosuke.

402
00:36:37.291 --> 00:36:42.000
Your uncle will be fine, right?

403
00:36:54.000 --> 00:36:54.833
President.

404
00:36:59.125 --> 00:37:00.333
I'm fine.

405
00:37:00.416 --> 00:37:02.250
It's nothing serious.

406
00:37:09.500 --> 00:37:11.041
I was worried.

407
00:37:13.666 --> 00:37:15.291
There is nothing.

408
00:37:17.875 --> 00:37:19.000
All this time…

409
00:37:21.375 --> 00:37:23.375
to protect me and the company…

410
00:37:26.708 --> 00:37:29.833
you carried this burden alone.

411
00:37:37.208 --> 00:37:39.208
I'm sorry I couldn't…

412
00:37:41.208 --> 00:37:42.166
support you.

413
00:37:49.291 --> 00:37:50.833
Even at a time like this...

414
00:37:53.416 --> 00:37:56.541
I still can't touch you.

415
00:38:20.916 --> 00:38:22.916
- Sosuke.
- Don't touch me!

416
00:39:35.708 --> 00:39:37.041
Savior.

417
00:39:39.041 --> 00:39:42.625
What does it mean?

418
00:39:45.166 --> 00:39:46.625
Someone who saves.

419
00:39:48.416 --> 00:39:50.125
Someone who saves?

420
00:39:51.916 --> 00:39:57.958
If I can offer to someone passing by
through difficult life a little bit of salvation

421
00:39:58.708 --> 00:40:01.416
in the form of sweets…

422
00:40:03.458 --> 00:40:06.666
I couldn't wish for anything more.

423
00:40:10.291 --> 00:40:11.375
Salvation…

424
00:40:36.083 --> 00:40:40.458
Od dziś będę pracować w kuchni.

425
00:40:40.541 --> 00:40:42.708
I'm Lee Hana, pastry chef.

426
00:40:42.791 --> 00:40:45.125
I count on fruitful cooperation.

427
00:40:48.875 --> 00:40:55.041
I realized
that I blame my mother and the past

428
00:40:55.125 --> 00:40:57.208
for all my actions.

429
00:40:58.458 --> 00:41:00.375
Sharing my story

430
00:41:01.041 --> 00:41:05.458
was a real time of growth for me.

431
00:41:06.625 --> 00:41:07.791
Thank you.

432
00:41:08.375 --> 00:41:10.166
Thank you, Irene.

433
00:41:10.666 --> 00:41:13.083
And now, James,

434
00:41:13.166 --> 00:41:15.875
maybe you will tell us about your past?

435
00:41:25.750 --> 00:41:27.416
Dear Dr. Irene,

436
00:41:27.916 --> 00:41:29.291
how are you?

437
00:41:29.375 --> 00:41:34.458
A year has already passed
since you started this long journey.

438
00:41:35.166 --> 00:41:39.500
Futago Sweets Mission
are not only excellent products.

439
00:41:39.583 --> 00:41:43.500
Sosuke works tirelessly,
to introduce changes and innovations

440
00:41:43.583 --> 00:41:46.666
as president of Futago Sweets.

441
00:41:47.875 --> 00:41:50.416
Motomi, our newly appointed president,

442
00:41:50.500 --> 00:41:52.583
he has a lot on his mind right now.

443
00:41:52.666 --> 00:41:57.458
Not only does he make chocolates,
but he also runs the entire store.

444
00:41:57.541 --> 00:42:01.500
Let us continue to try our best

445
00:42:01.583 --> 00:42:04.208
bring joy
with our chocolates.

446
00:42:05.000 --> 00:42:07.000
With all my heart, today and always...

447
00:42:07.083 --> 00:42:09.041
With all my heart.

448
00:42:09.125 --> 00:42:10.541
Let's give it our all.

449
00:42:10.625 --> 00:42:12.500
We will do our best.

450
00:42:13.625 --> 00:42:16.125
As for me, I work in the kitchen

451
00:42:16.208 --> 00:42:19.458
and I protect tradition with everyone,

452
00:42:19.541 --> 00:42:22.541
although sometimes we are open to changes.

453
00:42:22.625 --> 00:42:26.500
I create everyday joy
in the form of chocolates.

454
00:42:28.208 --> 00:42:30.500
- Here's yuzu.
- Thanks.

455
00:42:30.583 --> 00:42:32.833
Boss Motomi, it's a peach blossom.

456
00:42:32.916 --> 00:42:35.000
I see. It's beautiful.

457
00:42:35.583 --> 00:42:40.625
I do it with the belief that it brings joy to the chocolatier
can be shared with others.

458
00:42:41.666 --> 00:42:44.291
- Oh my.
- Looks good.

459
00:42:44.375 --> 00:42:45.708
Yes.

460
00:42:45.791 --> 00:42:47.416
- What?
- What?

461
00:42:52.875 --> 00:42:54.083
Please.

462
00:42:58.958 --> 00:43:01.333
This is beautiful.

463
00:43:03.375 --> 00:43:04.583
Beautiful.

464
00:43:05.833 --> 00:43:10.333
I hope wherever you are,
you are happy.

465
00:43:11.250 --> 00:43:14.125
From your friend Lee Hana.

466
00:44:03.041 --> 00:44:05.750
You look stunning.

467
00:44:06.458 --> 00:44:07.416
Thanks.

468
00:44:10.416 --> 00:44:11.250
All good?

469
00:44:13.750 --> 00:44:16.708
I'm sorry the president insisted
even though we didn't want a ceremony.

470
00:44:18.500 --> 00:44:19.541
Never mind.

471
00:44:20.916 --> 00:44:24.333
As long as we are together
I think I can handle it.

472
00:44:25.208 --> 00:44:26.583
I'll try too.

473
00:44:28.833 --> 00:44:30.500
With love we can do it.

474
00:44:30.583 --> 00:44:32.458
It'll be fine, right?

475
00:44:33.291 --> 00:44:34.125
Yes.

476
00:44:35.125 --> 00:44:36.500
If we are together.

477
00:44:36.583 --> 00:44:39.250
We're about to start the wedding

478
00:44:39.333 --> 00:44:42.000
in the presence of all guests.

479
00:44:42.083 --> 00:44:44.250
The couple will exchange vows

480
00:44:44.333 --> 00:44:46.958
and will receive thanks

481
00:44:47.041 --> 00:44:49.083
during this civil ceremony.

482
00:44:49.666 --> 00:44:52.708
We hope
that we will be witnesses together

483
00:44:52.791 --> 00:44:55.666
this new chapter in their lives.

484
00:44:55.750 --> 00:44:59.750
Please wait a moment
until the ceremony begins.

485
00:45:01.750 --> 00:45:03.583
Sorry!

486
00:45:12.916 --> 00:45:14.625
Another coincidence?

487
00:45:16.833 --> 00:45:18.708
Of course not.

488
00:45:20.875 --> 00:45:25.416
I woke up early and put in more effort
in getting ready than a bride.

489
00:45:35.458 --> 00:45:36.458
I see.

490
00:45:36.541 --> 00:45:39.000
You think to yourself, “Here he goes again.”

491
00:45:42.291 --> 00:45:44.166
Do you remember what you told me?

492
00:45:44.958 --> 00:45:49.083
You said our future
belongs to us.

493
00:45:55.250 --> 00:45:57.375
So here's my pick.

494
00:46:02.083 --> 00:46:04.000
I want to start from here.

495
00:46:05.125 --> 00:46:06.875
I'm Airi Namikawa.

496
00:46:17.541 --> 00:46:19.916
I have nothing to say?

497
00:46:21.916 --> 00:46:24.541
Ladies and gentlemen,
please look at the back door.

498
00:46:24.625 --> 00:46:26.375
Here comes the groom, Sosuke!

499
00:46:26.458 --> 00:46:30.041
Quick! This is embarrassing! It's about to start.

500
00:46:50.333 --> 00:46:51.708
Congratulations!

501
00:46:51.791 --> 00:46:52.833
President!

502
00:47:03.625 --> 00:47:07.875
And now the beautiful bride enters.

503
00:47:07.958 --> 00:47:10.250
Let's welcome her with hearty applause.

504
00:47:59.583 --> 00:48:02.875
Impatient groom
he wants to guide the bride.

505
00:48:14.083 --> 00:48:15.041
Are you okay?

506
00:48:17.708 --> 00:48:18.583
I can't.

507
00:48:52.208 --> 00:48:53.625
Congratulations!

508
00:49:07.791 --> 00:49:09.375
Are we crazy?

509
00:49:09.875 --> 00:49:13.291
Entirely. We're not normal anyway.

510
00:49:13.375 --> 00:49:15.916
We're totally crazy!

511
00:49:16.000 --> 00:49:18.958
Yes and it's amazing!

512
00:49:19.458 --> 00:49:21.291
Saranghae!

513
00:49:21.375 --> 00:49:24.041
Naega deo saranghae!

514
00:50:15.125 --> 00:50:16.625
Hello everyone.

515
00:50:17.541 --> 00:50:18.916
Are you nervous?

516
00:50:20.458 --> 00:50:24.458
Thank you for joining
to my Anonymous Circle.

517
00:50:24.958 --> 00:50:30.208
During these sessions
many people have experienced their symptoms.

518
00:50:30.708 --> 00:50:33.958
I believe you will benefit from it too.

519
00:50:34.625 --> 00:50:36.458
Starting from this cycle,

520
00:50:36.541 --> 00:50:40.541
we have a new therapist,
who joined us.

521
00:50:46.125 --> 00:50:48.833
Good morning, my name is Ando.

522
00:50:49.416 --> 00:50:50.833
I'm very pleased.

523
00:50:53.083 --> 00:50:55.541
Let's work on this together.

524
00:50:57.250 --> 00:50:58.958
- Yes.
- Yes.

525
00:51:16.583 --> 00:51:17.625
Sorry.

526
00:51:18.541 --> 00:51:20.333
If it's not too late

527
00:51:21.458 --> 00:51:23.041
can I still join?

528
00:51:28.833 --> 00:51:29.916
Sure.

529
00:51:31.458 --> 00:51:32.375
Hello.

530
00:55:50.333 --> 00:55:53.166
Subtitles: Grzegorz Marczyk

